<p>If you are a Prime member, you can claim any one of the eight main picks plus the short read — two books total — at no charge. Non-Prime readers pay $1.99 each. The same list is curated by Amazon's editors monthly, so the September selection skews toward cozy/seasonal reads (Pumpkin, Turkey Trouble) and fall-themed mysteries, which is consistent with the September pattern in past years.</p>
