<p>You lose access to the free claim, but the books are still purchasable at their regular list prices ($4.99 to $5.99 for the September selections). Many First Reads titles also appear in Kindle Unlimited later in their life cycle — the September picks typically rotate into KU 4-6 weeks after the First Reads window closes, depending on the publisher's marketing plan. Watch the author's Amazon author page if you missed a First Reads pick you wanted; KU enrollment is the most common second chance, and library lending via Libby is the third.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>

